Destructo: credits and licences

Code: this repository (MIT, see LICENSE). The levels, every mesh, every texture of the blocks and the field, every
sound and the HUD are made by code in this repository (src/levels.c, src/view.c, src/sound.c); no third-party art or
audio is shipped. The landmarks' shapes below are the exception.

- assets/fx/fire.png, fire_mv.png, smoke.png, smoke_mv.png, scorch.png (fire and smoke flipbooks with their
  motion-vector sheets, the scorch shapes): baked by cartwheel-engine's tools/fx/bake-flipbooks.mjs (procedural, CC0,
  listed in the engine's NOTICE): node <engine>/tools/fx/bake-flipbooks.mjs games/destructo/assets/fx
- The explosion kit's particle settings follow hordeshooter's in more-cartwheel-examples (MIT, the same author).

The launcher art (art/) is made from the game's own frames by tools/make-art.sh; its logo is set in Fira Sans Bold
(SIL Open Font License 1.1, from cartwheel-engine's samples/ui_assets/fonts).

Landmark shapes (src/lm_data.c). Some landmarks are laid from openly licensed 3D models: tools/voxelize.mjs turns
each model into the cells the game builds in bricks (tools/landmark-models.json holds the settings; the models
themselves are not in this repository). The brick layout made from a model is an adaptation of it, under the
model's licence:

