  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:EiffelTower_fixed.stl (first published as Thingiverse thing:912478).
  Share-alike: the Eiffel Tower's cells in src/lm_data.c (the block between "begin eiffel" and "end eiffel") are
  under CC BY-SA 3.0 too, not MIT.
- Leaning Tower of Pisa: "The Leaning Tower of Pisa" by Emmanouel Diaz Dominguez, Creative Commons Attribution
