The other landmarks (the Great Sphinx, the Pyramids of Giza, the Space Needle, the Sydney Opera House, Neuschwanstein
Castle, Willis Tower, the Empire State Building, the Colosseum, the Parthenon, Tower Bridge, Saint Basil's Cathedral,
the Petronas Towers, Angkor Wat, the CN Tower and Stonehenge) are shaped in this repository's code
(tools/landmark-procs.mjs, src/landmarks.c), MIT.
